WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:03.290
(cheerful music)

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:04.123
- Hi Drew.

00:00:04.123 --> 00:00:06.410
My name is Simone and I am in my hometown

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.940
of Baltimore, Maryland.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.910
I love Baltimore because
it has so much history,

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.840
so much beauty, but the
thing I love most here

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.530
is the food scene.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.280
I'm a food blogger here in the area,

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.880
so I post all the best eats
and drinks in Baltimore.

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.949
So I want to show you around

00:00:21.949 --> 00:00:25.460
to several of Baltimore's
most fun and exciting

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.060
and delicious food destinations.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.070
First stop is Belvedere Square Market.

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.210
Say hello to my friends
at Neopol Savory Smokery.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.260
In general, they sell all
kinds of smoked goods,

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:40.800
but Neopol sells my favorite
sandwich in Baltimore,

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.143
their salmon BLT

00:00:42.143 --> 00:00:45.670
and their famous New
Zealand smoked mussels.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.140
These are a must try here in Baltimore.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.910
For dessert, ice cream from
Prigel Family Creamery.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.530
Mandy here is going to help us out.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.230
They are a family owned creamery

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.130
right beside of Belvedere Square,

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:58.830
and they have a farm out in the county,

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:01.960
but they make their ice
cream fresh every day.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.500
My cameraman here got
their strawberry ice cream

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.760
with sprinkles and a cherry on top.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.980
Last stop at Belvedere Square
Market is Tasha Flowers.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.920
I come to Tasha to get my
bouquets for my living room,

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.680
kitchen, bedroom for the week.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:17.050
- So I'm going to grab
this Asiatic lily here

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:17.883
because look at that.

00:01:17.883 --> 00:01:20.460
- Yes.
- It is perfectly opened.

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:23.210
- That's just a little peak
of Belvedere Square Market.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.200
Now moving onto our second stop.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.860
Welcome to chat hour at
Good Neighbor Coffee Shop.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.253
We'll have some very creative appetizers,

00:01:32.253 --> 00:01:34.163
great conversation.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.445
So amazing.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:39.990
Our third stop is here on the water.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.780
Welcome to the Baltimore
Water Taxi sunset cruise.

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:45.350
Here, you bring your
favorite snacks and drinks

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:46.770
and cruise along the inner harbor,

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:48.230
watching the sun go down

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:51.210
and just the beautiful
skyline of Baltimore.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.043
Well Drew,

00:01:52.043 --> 00:01:54.640
that's just a small look at my
beautiful city of Baltimore.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.510
I hope you loved it as much as I do,

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:58.018
and I hope to see you here soon.

00:01:58.018 --> 00:01:58.851
Bye.

